# Instrument PC export 2031-09-15 (Kofi Mensah), decimal-comma locale
Literature (fictional group, 2029) quotes a Km of roughly 507 uM for a related enzyme; not our construct.
Blank BLK-06 (no enzyme): 0.0008 uM/s, as usual.
Enzyme stock (lot 7285-C, 1.2 mg/mL) thawed on ice; working dilution as recorded in the master-mix log.
Spoke with facilities about the door badge; nothing that affects the data.
Made 1000 mL of 25 mM MOPS and adjusted to pH 8.5 at 42 °C.
Room temperature 21.7 °C, humidity 45%.
Exported from the instrument PC, which uses a decimal comma (0,5 means one half). Columns carry the units.

