Took 6 photos of the plate for the ELN; filenames IMG_4326 onwards.
Assay mix per well: 175 uL buffer, 10 uL NADH, 10 uL substrate dilution, enzyme last (5 uL) to start.
Mixed plate on the orbital shaker for 5 s before each read.
Shared the reader with the structural group from 12:00; nothing else of note.
Pathlength correction is off in the reader template (does not matter for slopes we report).
Plate sealed with the clear lid; reads every 30 s, slopes from the linear part.
